+	// A create that did not report success has not necessarily failed. A lost
+	// response, a dropped connection or a 5xx leaves the outcome unknown, and a
+	// duplicate-name rejection says the pool exists whoever made it. In all of
+	// those cases the appliance is the authority on what happened, so ask it
+	// instead of sending a second create.
+	if !mayHaveLanded(createErr) {
+		return EnsureResult{}, createErr
